# The CCC&TSPM CD-ROM (CCCPBible/) and what was extracted from it. The
# 新标点和合本 is public domain and is kept; the 现代中文译本, the NRSV and
# the GNT are not, and neither are the installers and the Access databases
# that carry all four, so they stay on this machine. They are held under the
# CD-ROM's own licence and are read by a person checking a translation - not
# by anything in the pipeline, which translates from the Hebrew and Greek.
CCCPBible/*
!CCCPBible/README.md
!CCCPBible/和合本_新标点_简体.csv
!CCCPBible/和合本_新标点_简体.json
!CCCPBible/和合本_新标点_简体.txt

# A shortcut to the dashboard on this machine, not part of the project.
eBible * live translation.url

# Reference Bibles fetched by scripts/get_references.py. Public domain, but
# they are a reference read on this machine, not something this project
# republishes: what leaves here is a list of name spellings.
sources/references/

# What was asked of the model through the PC search (scripts/ask.py): kept so a
# question is answered once, and kept here because what someone searched their
# Bible for is theirs.
logs/ask/
